    "text": "The function <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> is the solution of the differential equation <math><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><msqrt><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></math> in (- 1 , 1) satisfying <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo></math> Then <math><mrow><munderover><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#8747;</mo><mrow><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow><mrow><mfrac><mrow><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></munderover><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></mrow></math> is",
